---
---

<div id="product" class="section bordered subtle-bg">
  <div class="wide">
    <div class="narrow center section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow muted">The product</div>
      <div class="h2">Everything you need. Nothing you don't.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">DAILY CHECK-IN</div>
        <div class="card-body">Know how you're doing today.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">ADAPTIVE WORKOUTS</div>
        <div class="card-body">A session built around your current state.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">WORKOUT LOGGING</div>
        <div class="card-body">Log sets, reps and RPE as you train.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-label">PROGRESS</div>
        <div class="card-body">See how your training evolves over time.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="closing">
      <div class="h2">Real life doesn't follow a training plan.<br />So why should your training app?</div>
      <p class="lede-center">
        Personal-TrAIner adapts your training to how you're actually doing — today, and every day after.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-col">
        <a href="/login" class="btn-accent">Get started</a>
        <span class="fineprint">Currently invite-only.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .section {
    padding: 100px 0 120px;
  }

  .section.bordered {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .section.subtle-bg {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015);
  }

  .wide {
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 clamp(24px, 5vw, 64px);
  }

  .narrow {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-head {
    margin: 0 auto 56px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .eyebrow.muted {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .h2 {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.6vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .card-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 100px;
  }

  .card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 30px 26px;
  }

  .card-label {
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, monospace;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .card-body {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.55);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .closing {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: 90px;
  }

  .closing .h2 {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .lede-center {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.55);
    margin: 0 0 40px;
  }

  .cta-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .btn-accent {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 700;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 17px 38px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .btn-accent:hover {
    background: var(--accent-hover);
    color: var(--bg);
  }

  .fineprint {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
